For buyers who want to save money at VS2: use a retailer with 360° video, request the clarity plot, and verify that inclusions are positioned at the girdle edges rather than the table center. [Blue Nile's diamond detail pages](https://www.bluenile.com/diamonds/emerald-cut?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) show 360° video for individual stones, which makes VS2 inspection practical for online buyers.

