</table>

Color is also affected by setting choice. A [yellow gold setting](/emerald-cut-diamond-ring-yellow-gold) reflects warm color into the diamond and pairs well with G–H color stones. A platinum or white gold setting is unforgiving of body color — pair it with F or better.

In white metal settings, F color is the practical recommendation for emerald cuts. G is acceptable and will read as white to most people in everyday wear. H and below start to show warmth in white metal under certain lighting conditions.

